@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Admin" as U
participant "Admin Console" as C
participant "Express API" as A
participant "Supabase" as S
participant "Activity Log" as L

U -> C: Fill template form + uploads
C -> A: POST /api/admin/templates (multipart)
A -> A: validateTemplate + withUploads
A -> S: assertSlugAvailable(slug)
S --> A: slug free
A -> S: templates.insert(payload)
S --> A: created row
A -> S: syncTags(templateId, tags)
A -> L: record template.created
A --> C: 201 template
C --> U: Show in template list
note over S: A duplicate slug is rejected with 409 before insert.
@enduml
